    gmeow:coverageDepthPassingMention      a gmeow:CoverageDepth .
    gmeow:coverageDepthRoutineFiling       a gmeow:CoverageDepth .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "The three CoverageDepth seed individuals (significant coverage, passing mention, routine filing) MUST exist." .

